        a. Not clickable unless userId is entered
        b. Clicking on it will load entire PRE-FILLED entire dubbing page using data available in DuckDB corresponding to this user.
    3. A button 'Reset' beside it
        a. Not clickable unless userId is entered
        b. Clicking on it will clear the data corresponding to this user and load fresh dubbing page.
- What all things to save corresponding to this userId:
    1. Path to the main source video/audio files being dubbed
    2. Target language selected for translation
    3. List of all segments generated from the audio. For each segment, you must save:
        a. Start and end timestamps
        b. The original transcribed text
        c. The translated text
        d. The selected speaker (AP, MALE, FEMALE)
    4. Path to the final dubbed audio/video
- Progress saving frequency:
    1. Auotsave every 5 minutes
    2. Upon autosave, show a small notification
    3. If user wants to reset, there is a button 'Reset' at the top of the page

